---
title: "Crazy Seal's copy of Shopify orders"
---
stateDiagram-v2
  state "Legend" as legend {
    lg0: Up to date
    lg1: Catching up
    lg2: Wrong
    lg3: Breaks DeletedStaysDeleted or NeverGoesBack
    lg4: Path to the DeletedStaysDeleted or NeverGoesBack bug
  }
  class lg0 teal
  class lg1 blue
  class lg2 pink
  class lg3 breaks
  class lg4 bugPath
  s0: Our copy matches Shopify
  s1: An order is behind Shopify, the next refresh will fetch it
  s2: An order deleted in Shopify is still in our copy, after a delete was undone
  s3: An order is behind Shopify, the next refresh will fetch it, after an older copy overwrote a newer one
  [*] --> s0
  s0 --> s0: an admin page load starts a refresh or the order is deleted in Shopify
  s0 --> s1: an order changes in Shopify
  s1 --> s1: the update webhook asks Shopify for the order
  s0 --> s2: the refresh writes an order it fetched earlier
  s1 --> s0: the webhook writes what it got
  s0 --> s3: the refresh writes an order it fetched earlier
  classDef breaks fill:#ffecee,stroke:#e72e3b,stroke-width:2.5px,color:#cd2834
  class s0 teal
  class s0 bugPath
  class s1 blue
  class s1 bugPath
  class s2 pink
  class s2 breaks
  class s2 bugPath
  class s3 pink
  class s3 breaks
  class s3 bugPath
